cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this tool, cite it as below."
title: "acmg-variant-curation"
abstract: >-
  An Agent Skills package that derives ACMG/AMP 2015 codes for germline SNVs/indels
  from ClinVar, gnomAD, Ensembl VEP and PubMed, printing the evidence basis for every
  code and refusing pathogenic codes on unverified variant identifiers.
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/darshak26/acmg-variant-curation"
keywords:
  - acmg
  - variant-interpretation
  - vus
  - variant-of-uncertain-significance
  - clinvar
  - gnomad
  - bioinformatics
  - agent-skills
